BANKER TIPS — GOAL API LIVE SCORES AND AUTOMATIC SETTLEMENT

Provider
--------
Banker Tips uses GOAL API (https://goal-api.com/) through its REST API.
Documentation: https://goal-api.com/documentation

Render environment variables
-----------------------------
GOAL_API_KEY=your_GOAL_API_key
GOAL_SYNC_INTERVAL_MS=600000
APP_TIME_ZONE=Africa/Nairobi

Keep GOAL_API_KEY in Render Environment Variables. Never put it in public/index.html, browser JavaScript, or a committed .env file.

How synchronization works
-------------------------
- The server polls GOAL API's /fixtures/live endpoint and date-specific fixture endpoints.
- It matches pending Free Tips and Premium Tips by exact normalized home/away team order, and optionally league name. Ambiguous matches are left untouched.
- Scores and provider match status are stored on each matched tip and returned by the existing tips APIs.
- A tip is settled only after the provider reports a finished status and the market is one of the implemented, unambiguous markets: 1X2, Double Chance, Over/Under, or BTTS.
- Cancelled matches are marked Void. Postponed matches remain Pending. Abandoned or unsupported markets are not automatically settled.
- Correct Score, Asian Handicap, Draw No Bet, corners, cards, player markets and other unsupported markets require manual settlement.
- Free and Premium tips use the same synchronization and settlement logic.

Admin endpoints
---------------
GET  /api/admin/football/status  — provider configuration and last sync status
POST /api/admin/football/sync    — run a manual sync (admin session + CSRF protection required)

Important deployment notes
---------------------------
- Set GOAL_API_KEY in Render before deploying this version.
- Set GOAL_SYNC_INTERVAL_MS to 600000 (10 minutes) initially; do not lower it without checking your GOAL API request allowance.
- The API free plan has a finite request allowance. The service checks only dates associated with pending tips (up to four distinct tip dates per cycle) plus the live fixtures snapshot.
- If multiple fixtures match the same teams, no automatic fixture assignment is made unless an existing GOAL fixture ID resolves the ambiguity.
- Review unsupported prediction formats and team-name aliases in the admin panel. Manual settlement remains available.
- Verify actual competition coverage and your plan quota in the GOAL API dashboard.
